Nevertheless, we can declare the expected schema for the request body.

### Custom OpenAPI content type { #custom-openapi-content-type }

Using this same trick, you could use a Pydantic model to define the JSON Schema that is then included in the custom OpenAPI schema section for the *path operation*.", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 150, "total_lines": 204, "is_truncated": true}

